<view class="page reader-page"><app-nav title="文档阅读" back /><view class="reader-head row"><view class="grow reader-copy"><text class="reader-title">{{document.filename || '文档'}}</text><text class="muted block">{{metaLabel}}{{metaLabel ? ' · ' : ''}}{{document.status === 'completed' ? '已完成解析' : '处理中'}}</text></view></view><button wx:if="{{canPreview}}" class="preview-entry {{previewing ? 'busy' : ''}}" bindtap="previewOriginal" disabled="{{previewing}}"><view class="preview-entry-icon"><ui-icon name="{{previewIcon}}" size="{{38}}" rpx /></view><view class="grow preview-entry-copy"><text class="preview-entry-title">{{previewing ? '正在打开原文…' : '原文预览'}}</text><text class="preview-entry-desc">按原文件版式打开，图表、排版与分页保持原样</text></view><ui-icon name="chevron-right" size="{{24}}" rpx /></button><view wx:if="{{document.organize_status === 'completed'}}" class="card organize-card"><view class="organize-heading"><text class="organize-label">已整理</text><text class="muted organize-method">{{document.organize_method === 'llm' ? '智能整理' : '基础整理'}}</text></view><text class="organize-title">{{document.organized_title}}</text><text class="organize-summary">{{document.summary}}</text><view wx:if="{{document.tags.length}}" class="tag-list"><text wx:for="{{document.tags}}" wx:key="*this" class="tag">{{item}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{document.key_points.length}}" class="point-list"><text wx:for="{{document.key_points}}" wx:key="*this" class="point">{{index + 1}}. {{item}}</text></view></view><view wx:elif="{{document.organize_status === 'processing'}}" class="organize-pending">正在整理这份资料，稍后刷新即可查看摘要</view><view wx:if="{{isHtml}}" class="card document-content article-content"><rich-text nodes="{{htmlContent}}"></rich-text></view><view wx:elif="{{textUnavailable && canPreview}}" class="card document-content reader-empty"><text class="reader-empty-title">这类文件以原文预览查看</text><text class="reader-empty-desc">服务端不解析它的正文，版式、图表与批注都以原文为准，点上方「原文预览」即可打开。</text></view><view wx:elif="{{textUnavailable}}" class="card document-content reader-empty"><text class="reader-empty-title">暂无正文</text><text class="reader-empty-desc">这份资料还没有可用于阅读的文本，解析完成后会在这里显示。</text></view><view wx:else class="card document-content"><block wx:for="{{visibleSections}}" wx:key="key"><view wx:if="{{item.page}}" class="page-flag">第 {{item.page}} 页</view><text class="reader-text">{{item.text}}</text></block><view wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="reader-more">继续下滑，正在加载后面的内容…</view></view></view>
